                "title": "CPU 7468 Highways Gully Cleaning and Road Sweeping Framework",
                "description": "Nottingham City Council (the 'Authority' or 'Employer') sought tenders from suitably experienced and qualified entities (the 'Tenderer') for inclusion on a framework for Gully Cleaning (Mechanical) & Road Sweeping (Mechanical) throughout the boundaries of Nottingham City Council. \nThis Framework is to consist of 2 separate lots. \nSubject to suitability, the Authority is seeking to appoint up to 3 Contractors to each lot.\nThe overall framework will have an estimated total value of £700,000 (VAT exclusive).\nThe Framework duration is expected to be for up to 4 years at the authority's discretion.",
